# Response headers for the website (Cloudflare Pages reads this file; so does
# Netlify. GitHub Pages ignores it, and the site works without it).
# scripts/build_site.sh copies it into _site/. Deploy notes:
# docs/WEBSITE_DEPLOY.md.
#
# HOW TO READ IT: a line with no indent is a path; the indented lines under
# it are the headers sent for that path. `*` matches anything.
#
# IMPORTANT (Cloudflare): when two rules match one path, Cloudflare JOINS
# their values for the same header name. So:
#   - the catch-all /* rule below has NO Cache-Control (each path sets its own);
#   - its Content-Security-Policy is the web app's policy. A joined policy is
#     safe: the browser reads "A, B" as two policies and enforces BOTH, so a
#     path with its own stricter policy (the legal pages, /data, /assets)
#     stays at least that strict. Any other address still gets the app's
#     policy. A missing address gets 404.html with status 404 (its presence
#     turns off Cloudflare's single-page fallback); under /data/ or /assets/
#     it also gets that folder's policy, so 404.html works as plain text.
# Cloudflare serves /privacy.html at /privacy (it drops ".html"), so each page
# is listed both ways. A new page needs its own rule here (and a line in
# scripts/build_site.sh).

# Every response.
#   HSTS: browsers use HTTPS only for this site for a year. ("preload" is left
#   out on purpose; add it only after this has run for a month.)
#   Content-Security-Policy (ENFORCED, web v12.28): what the web app loads and
#   nothing else. Scripts: this site, the inline scripts and onclick handlers
#   ('unsafe-inline' stays until they move into a .js file), Google Analytics
#   (loaded only after the visitor accepts) and Cloudflare Web Analytics.
#   Fonts are self-hosted. Connections: this site, the Google Forms used for
#   feedback and flags, Google Analytics, Cloudflare Web Analytics. No
#   plugins, no <base>, no framing.
#   Beta Desk (4 Nov 2026): the Supabase project (connect) and Cloudflare
#   Turnstile (script + frame, the sign-in check). They are here, and not
#   only in the /beta-desk rule, because Cloudflare JOINS this policy with
#   every page's own and the browser enforces both: a host missing here is
#   blocked everywhere. The web app's accounts need the same two hosts.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js https://static.cloudflareinsights.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.googletagmanager.com; connect-src 'self' https://docs.google.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://*.googletagmanager.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://ziadnvepttlgcowvqvom.supabase.co; frame-src https://docs.google.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com; form-action https://docs.google.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

# The home page. While SITE_MODE=landing (the default in
# scripts/build_site.sh) it is the beta landing page (a copy of beta.html), so
# it gets the same strict policy as /beta, joined with the /* policy (the
# browser enforces both). In SITE_MODE=app it is the web app, whose inline
# scripts that policy would block: the build drops these two lines from
# _site/_headers in app mode, and checks each mode. Remove them here when the
# web app reopens for good.
/
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; script-src 'sha256-nbMPt7DJNCogX1hWKTLNy0Fg4H3+bU/3Jfci1NXG084=' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
/index.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self'; script-src 'sha256-nbMPt7DJNCogX1hWKTLNy0Fg4H3+bU/3Jfci1NXG084=' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'

